sequenceDiagram
    participant ASCIIREQ-WRITER
    participant ASCIIREQ-DOCUMENT
    participant ASCIIDOC-RENDERER
    participant ASCIIREQ-READER
    actor Human

    ASCIIREQ-WRITER->>ASCIIREQ-DOCUMENT: creates
    ASCIIREQ-WRITER->>ASCIIREQ-DOCUMENT: updates

    Human->>ASCIIREQ-DOCUMENT: reads (raw AsciiReq syntax)

    Human->>ASCIIDOC-RENDERER: uses
    ASCIIDOC-RENDERER->>ASCIIREQ-DOCUMENT: reads (as ASCIIDOC-DOCUMENT)
    ASCIIDOC-RENDERER-->>Human: delivers a display

    Human->>ASCIIREQ-READER: uses
    ASCIIREQ-READER->>ASCIIREQ-DOCUMENT: reads
    ASCIIREQ-READER-->>Human: processes a task
